  "slug": "lost-and-found-order-form",
  "title": "Lost and Found Order Form",
  "subtitle": "Authorize the release of a stored item: ownership check, release method, shipping detail, and the signature that closes custody.",
  "description": "An original release order for stored found property. It records the item and its custody position, the ownership check performed before any release, the authorized release method with collection or shipping detail, the handover record and signature, open conditions, and a verified closeout that ends the venue's custody.",
  "use_case": "Use when a stored item has been matched to a claimant and the venue is ready to hand it back, whether collected in person or shipped. The order closes when the item has been received and the receipt is recorded, or the release is refused with a reason.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "order_identity",
      "title": "Release order identity and item custody",
      "guidance": "Bind the release to the tagged item and its current holder.",
