                "Parent or guardian",
                "Employer of the owner",
                "Group organizer"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "ownership_check",
      "title": "Ownership check before release",
      "guidance": "The check happens before the item is shown, not after.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "key": "ownership_steps",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Ownership check steps",
          "items": [
            "Claimant described the item before being shown it",
            "Distinguishing detail from the lost report matched what they described",
            "Claimant named contents that were not visible from outside",
            "Stay or event record confirms the claimant was on property",
            "Device ownership demonstrated by unlocking it or naming the account",
            "Where a third party claims, written authority from the owner obtained",
            "Where a minor's item is claimed, the claiming adult's relationship recorded",
            "Identity confirmed to the standard applicable policy requires"
          ],
          "guidance": "Confirm identity to the recorded standard. Do not photograph, copy, or transcribe the number from any identification document."
        },
        {
          "key": "check_result",
          "type": "fields",
          "label": "Ownership check result",
          "fields": [
            {
              "key": "check_outcome",
              "label": "Check outcome",
              "units": 1.35,
              "field_type": "choice",
              "options": [
                "Pending",
                "Satisfied",
                "Satisfied with conditions",
                "Not satisfied - held",
                "Not satisfied - refused"
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "checked_by",
              "label": "Checked by",
              "units": 1.0
            },
            {
              "key": "checked_at",
              "label": "Checked at",
              "units": 0.85
            },
            {
              "key": "evidence_recorded",
              "label": "Evidence recorded",
              "units": 1.3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "ownership_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Release authority and record boundary",
          "guidance": "Only the responsible manager may authorize release of identification documents, medication, payment cards, cash, or a high-value item, and none of those may be shipped without that authorization. This order does not determine legal ownership, resolve a competing claim, or transfer title. Where two people claim the same item, hold it and route the claim to the responsible manager under applicable policy."
        }
      ]
    },
