            "Contents listed and agreed with the claimant in writing",
            "Packed so the contents cannot be identified from the outside",
            "Tracked service used and the reference recorded",
            "Signature on delivery required for a high-value item",
            "Medication and perishables not shipped without manager authorization",
            "Claimant told the tracking reference and expected delivery"
          ]
